  fileType: 1
  fileName: datalog 7
  progressTowardsObjective: 0
  fileContents: "Date: May 26, 3199  \r\nSource: Yanthem Resistance \u2014 Final Audio Recording  \r\nRE: Fall of the Last Stronghold\r\n\r\n\u2593\u2592\u2588\uFFFD[DATA_LOST]#%\uFFFD\u2588\u2588\r\n\r\nThe last Yanthem stronghold has been leveled by the Goliath... That was our last hope. The machines have won. They strung up the others, mutilated them... I'm the only one l\uFFFDft. If anyone is hearing this, the v\uFFFDrus is still out there. The future isn't lost... even if I won't be there to see it. God, I miss the sun. If you find Clara, tell her I\u2019m s\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFDy... Tell her I\u2014\r\n\r\n(Single gunshot)\r\n\r\n[END OF AUDIO LOG \u2014 FILE INTEGRITY: 6\uFFFD%]"
  image: {fileID: 0}
